<title>POLAND: IRENA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>IRENA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.75 vs   0.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.06 vs   0.09</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.69 vs   0.24 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    5.57 vs   3.19</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.89 vs   4.91</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.32 vs   6.97</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.96 vs   3.63</p>
<p> Sales		   36.54 vs  34.61</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glass maker is Huta Szkla</p>
<p>Gospodarczego Irena SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
